        <div style=" margin-top:7.41pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:20pt;">
          <span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The value of restricted stock unit awards is based on the closing price of our common stock on the Nasdaq Global Select Market on December&#160;31, 2025, which was $3.93 per share. </span>
