        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:3.5pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:20pt;">
          <span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Dr.&#160;Sandrock&#8217;s stock option award to purchase 240,000 shares of our common stock was granted on February&#160;17, 2023. The shares underlying this option vest and become exercisable in equal monthly installments over 48&#160;months thereafter, subject to Dr.&#160;Sandrock&#8217;s continued service as an employee on each applicable vesting date. </span>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
